{
 "id": "CMP-17",
 "name": "hero-chart-widget",
 "version": 1,
 "title": "Hero and chart widget: home energy",
 "summary": "A big value with its change and caption, and a chart filling the rest, at widget size: the hero stacks over the chart when tall, sits beside it when wide, and the stats, axis and header drop when short. The total and peak come from the exported hourly array, so the host sends one list. It fits 160x160, 320x160, 240x240, 480x200 and 360x480.",
 "prompt": "Build a home energy widget: one big number for the last 24 hours with its change from the day before, a chart of each hour filling the rest, and peak, cost and solar stats when there is room. Stacked when tall, hero beside the chart when wide, secondary parts dropped when short. It must fit 320x160, 160x160, 360x480, 240x240 and 480x200.",
 "level": 2,
 "family": "CMP",
 "components": [
