 "pitfalls": [
  "The hero's caption is literal text in BigNumber; to let the host name the period, draw your own caption",
  "A column with an exact height and a verticalWeight child took all the height there was in the C++ and TS players, which put the chart's axis under the stats: size the plot exactly",
  "ifElse is (when false, when true, condition): ifElse(26, 32, step(@H, 300)) is 32 when tall",
  "Every host string needs its own starting value: equal strings share one text id, and setting one sets both (shared_string_value)",
  "Passing y_min 0 keeps the chart honest; LineChart's default scales to the array's minimum, which exaggerates small changes"
 ],
